VALUES ($aq$aqa-functions-24$aq$, 'gcse', $aq$aqa$aq$, $aq$functions$aq$, $aq$procedure-vs-function-usage$aq$, 3, 2, $aq$text$aq$, $aq$The following algorithm is written in pseudo-code.

